   "quote": "R4.5 **Order outcome.** When every fulfilment of a processing order is `completed`, `failed` or `cancelled`, set the order, within **120 min** of the event that ended the last one: `completed` if at least one fulfilment completed, otherwise `failed` if at least one failed, otherwise `cancelled`.",
